{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.nichika.second",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "屋顶上有个人在喊",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.nichika.second",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.nichika.second",
    "idolId": "nichika",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……好……起…………──！",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "喂、喂……！",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "────────成……了呀…………！",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……呀，成功了……！七草にちか，ごーうーかーくー────！",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……に、にちか小姐，邻居会听见的……！而且还不算正式入籍──",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "不能收回哦……！为了让姐姐也收不回去，我才这么大声的！",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "我……要在 283 制作……实习────！",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（除了果断，她就是个再平凡不过的……女孩子。）",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（──不过，喊出来的这句话，大概收不回去了。）",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "…………那个。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯？",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "刚才那个，请当作没听见哦。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……啊？",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "因为，要是没当成，多丢人啊──！",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……哈哈。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那，就当没听见。……明天开始，请多指教。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "…………はい。……よろしくお願いしますー。"
      }
    }
  },
